title: Fix bags-list on_idle benchmark fragility across MaxAutoRebagPerBlock values
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    The benchmark failed depending on `MaxAutoRebagPerBlock`.
    Fix by placing all regular nodes in the lowest bag and setting scores for all pending nodes.
    This makes the count deterministic (only `on_idle` moves nodes into higher bags) and exercises worst-case weight (every node triggers a full rebag).
crates:
- name: pallet-bags-list
  bump: none
- name: asset-hub-westend-runtime
  bump: patch
